  Ran 19 tests in 0.091s

  OK
  All checks passed!

Packed-prefix hardware results
------------------------------

Corrected packed prefixes of 1, 2, and 108 tasks each timed out with:

  tm execution failed w/ -110

These results do not isolate a failing task. Dense packing changes the compiled
spacing and discards bytes stored between task bases.

Original-prefix correction
--------------------------

For prefixes that start at task zero, the probe now preserves the complete
compiled task stream and only terminates the selected final task. Arbitrary
nonzero task starts still use the packed diagnostic layout.

